10de  NVIDIA Corporation
	0008  NV1 [STG2000X-B Series]
	0009  NV1 [NV1 Series]
	0018  NV3 [Riva 128]
	0019  NV3 [Riva 128ZX]
	0020  NV4 [Riva TNT]
		1043 0200  V3400 TNT
		1048 0c18  Erazor II SGRAM
		1048 0c19  Erazor II

C 00  Unclassified device
	00  Non-VGA unclassified device
	01  VGA compatible unclassified device
	05  Image coprocessor
C 01  Mass storage controller
	00  SCSI storage controller
		00  Vendor specific
		11  SCSI storage device (SOP target port using PQI)
		12  SCSI controller (SOP target port using PQI)
		13  SCSI storage device & controller (SOP target port using PQI)
		21  SCSI storage device (SOP target port using NVMe)
	01  IDE interface
		00  ISA Compatibility mode-only controller
		05  PCI native mode-only controller
		0a  ISA Compatibility mode controller, supports both channels switched to PCI native mode
		0f  PCI native mode controller, supports both channels switched to ISA compatibility mode
		80  ISA Compatibility mode-only controller, supports bus mastering
